WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.576 --> 00:00:14.777
Two Shopwell Supermarket workers walked toward True Savings Bank.

2
00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:16.618
They carried money bags.

3
00:00:16.638 --> 00:00:19.399
"Hurry up, Leo," one worker said.

4
00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:21.480
"Let's deposit this money.

5
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.220
Then we'll take our lunch break."

6
00:00:24.481 --> 00:00:27.162
Fwoosh! Something flashed past the workers.

7
00:00:28.082 --> 00:00:29.563
Leo gasped.

8
00:00:30.303 --> 00:00:31.704
"The money is gone!"

9
00:00:34.064 --> 00:00:36.106
"I'm totally going to win!"

10
00:00:36.306 --> 00:00:36.867
Jack said.

11
00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:39.929
Roxy and her friends were in Metro City Park.

12
00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:42.951
They were getting ready for a charity 5K race.

13
00:00:43.792 --> 00:00:45.834
The race was going to raise money for a homeless shelter.

14
00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:48.176
Runners from all over the city were there.

15
00:00:49.757 --> 00:00:51.679
Roxy, Terrell, and Mara stretched.

16
00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.121
Jack just checked his phone.

17
00:00:54.141 --> 00:00:57.363
"You should stretch, Jack," Roxy said.

18
00:00:57.383 --> 00:00:59.345
"Nah," Jack said.

19
00:00:59.365 --> 00:01:00.566
"I'm fast.

20
00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:02.888
After this race I'm going to run a marathon!"

21
00:01:03.836 --> 00:01:04.877
Mara rolled her eyes.

22
00:01:06.197 --> 00:01:07.758
Then she stood up and marched in place.

23
00:01:09.479 --> 00:01:10.420
"What are you doing?"

24
00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:11.340
Jack asked.

25
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:14.902
"I'm warming up my legs," Mara said.

26
00:01:14.922 --> 00:01:17.003
"My uncle is a runner.

27
00:01:17.023 --> 00:01:19.665
He taught me this warm-up exercise.

28
00:01:20.285 --> 00:01:23.327
He said it's important to move your legs before a race."

29
00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:26.108
Terrell got up and marched in place.

30
00:01:27.049 --> 00:01:27.769
Roxy did too.

31
00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.370
Jack laughed.

32
00:01:30.751 --> 00:01:32.152
"You three look silly!"

33
00:01:33.256 --> 00:01:34.737
A voice came over a loudspeaker.

34
00:01:34.757 --> 00:01:38.119
"Runners! The race is about to begin!"

35
00:01:39.881 --> 00:01:41.802
All the racers headed toward the starting line.

36
00:01:41.822 --> 00:01:44.984
"Good luck, everyone!"

37
00:01:45.244 --> 00:01:45.825
Roxy said.

38
00:01:45.845 --> 00:01:48.406
A volunteer fired the starting gun.

39
00:01:49.127 --> 00:01:50.768
Bang! The race began.

40
00:01:51.348 --> 00:01:52.269
Jack ran fast.

41
00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:55.591
Soon he was far ahead of his friends.

42
00:01:57.613 --> 00:01:58.894
But then he slowed down.

43
00:02:00.355 --> 00:02:02.196
Roxy, Terrell, and Mara caught up to him.

44
00:02:04.076 --> 00:02:05.137
Jack was breathing hard.

45
00:02:05.157 --> 00:02:08.919
"Is the race almost over?"

46
00:02:09.899 --> 00:02:10.760
Mara smiled.

47
00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:14.302
"You need to pace yourself, Jack.

48
00:02:14.922 --> 00:02:17.644
If you run too fast, you'll get tired quickly.

49
00:02:17.664 --> 00:02:20.705
Then you definitely won't win."

50
00:02:21.426 --> 00:02:23.467
Jack groaned as Mara ran ahead of him.

51
00:02:26.128 --> 00:02:27.049
Terrell smiled.

52
00:02:27.069 --> 00:02:29.831
"I know who could easily win this race!"

53
00:02:30.691 --> 00:02:31.471
Roxy laughed.

54
00:02:33.292 --> 00:02:36.354
"Rocket Girl has more important things to do, Terrell.

55
00:02:37.455 --> 00:02:38.175
But you're right.

56
00:02:38.596 --> 00:02:40.737
She could easily win this race!"

57
00:02:41.718 --> 00:02:42.899
The two friends laughed.

58
00:02:46.001 --> 00:02:47.022
Roxy's watch beeped.

59
00:02:48.042 --> 00:02:49.243
She moved over to the side.

60
00:02:50.404 --> 00:02:51.465
Runners ran past her.

61
00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:53.446
She pretended to tie her shoe.

62
00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.851
Bloom?" Roxy whispered.

63
00:02:59.871 --> 00:03:01.232
"What's wrong?"

64
00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.641
Mayor Bloom scratched his head.

65
00:03:04.422 --> 00:03:05.903
"I'm not sure, Rocket Girl.

66
00:03:06.623 --> 00:03:08.525
The police got a lot of calls this morning.

67
00:03:09.285 --> 00:03:11.387
Money and other items seem to be vanishing."

68
00:03:11.407 --> 00:03:13.708
"Are people getting robbed?"

69
00:03:14.028 --> 00:03:14.709
Roxy asked.

70
00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:16.550
Mayor Bloom shrugged.

71
00:03:17.411 --> 00:03:18.231
"Nobody knows.

72
00:03:19.152 --> 00:03:20.753
I need you to go to Gem's Jewelry.

73
00:03:21.113 --> 00:03:22.234
The owner just called.

74
00:03:22.955 --> 00:03:25.456
She said all of her jewelry suddenly disappeared."

75
00:03:25.477 --> 00:03:28.078
"Okay, Mayor," Roxy said.

76
00:03:28.098 --> 00:03:30.020
"I'm on my way!"
